              "text": "procus, procī — \"a suitor\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Multī procī fīliam rēgis petunt. Many suitors seek the king's daughter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine, second declension; usually plural. A word of epic and comedy."
            }
          ]
        },
